WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.613 --> 00:00:02.237
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> We need <b>an</b> apple.

2
00:00:03.812 --> 00:00:05.701
We need <b>some</b> apples.

3
00:00:07.143 --> 00:00:08.866
We need <b>some</b> butter.

4
00:00:11.451 --> 00:00:13.888
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> We don’t need <b>a</b> tomato.

5
00:00:15.545 --> 00:00:18.346
We don’t need <b>any</b> tomatoes.

6
00:00:19.986 --> 00:00:22.356
We don’t need <b>any</b> rice.

7
00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:27.179
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> Do we need <b>an</b> orange?

8
00:00:28.455 --> 00:00:30.758
Do we need <b>any</b> oranges?

9
00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:34.172
Do we need <b>any</b> sugar?